&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active DoD Secret or Top Secret clearance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience designing electronics for &lt;strong&gt;space, missile, or hypersonic environments&lt;/strong&gt; (accounting for extreme vibration, thermal vacuum, and radiation-tolerant/rad-hard considerations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience with ECAD design tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Altium Designer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience designing high-reliability hardware in fast-iterating environments (e.g., new-space, aerospace startups, or fast-paced defense programs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience with RCC-319 and Flight Termination System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Understanding of battery management systems (BMS), high/low voltage power distribution, and actuator/motor drive electronics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
