&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with one or more microcontroller cores (ARM, AVR, MSP430, PIC, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience integrating microcontrollers with analog and digital sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Debugging experience with JTAG, SWD, oscilloscopes, or logic analyzers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CAN, Ethernet, USB, RS232, or RS485&lt;/li&gt;
