&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Design Engineer focused on DFM/DFA&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the critical intersection of product design and production reality. You will be directly responsible for designing robust, mission-ready, and highly manufacturable hardware across Anduril’s portfolio of autonomous air, land, and maritime systems.&amp;nbsp; You will own components and assemblies from concept through prototype fabrication and high-rate production, ensuring our hardware can be rapidly built, scaled, and deployed at the speed of mission need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply rigorous DFM and DFA principles across all phases of product development to maximize production throughput, reliability, and cost-efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Discipline Mechanical Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Design parts and complex assemblies leveraging a wide range of manufacturing processes:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Welded structures (MIG, TIG, FCAW, and automated processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Precision 3-axis and 5-axis CNC machining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Injection-molded plastics and tooling considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Advanced composite manufacturing (layup, molding, and secondary operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Structural bonding, encapsulation, and adhesive joining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drawing Definition &amp;amp; GD&amp;amp;T:&lt;/strong&gt; Author, check, and release fully defined engineering drawing packages in strict accordance with &lt;strong&gt;ASME Y14.5&lt;/strong&gt; standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop detailed, visual work instructions, process sheets, and assembly documentation that enable seamless execution on the production floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform comprehensive 1D/3D tolerance stack-up analyses, design reviews, and DFMEAs to de-risk manufacturing and assembly bottlenecks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Floor Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work shoulder-to-shoulder with Manufacturing, Tooling, Quality, and Supply Chain teams to troubleshoot issues, implement rapid design iterations, and streamline production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor junior hardware engineers in drawing standards, GD&amp;amp;T application, and practical manufacturing best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, Aerospace Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of hands-on mechanical design experience with a deep, proven focus on Design for Manufacturing (DFM) and Design for Assembly (DFA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;High proficiency with modern 3D CAD software (SolidWorks, NX, Creo) and associated PDM/PLM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Expert-level understanding and practical application of &lt;strong&gt;ASME Y14.5 (GD&amp;amp;T)&lt;/strong&gt; for engineering drawings and tolerance stack-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Deep domain experience designing for at least three of the following:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Complex weldments and welded joint architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Precision machining and sheet metal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Tooling and part design for injection molding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Composite structures and manufacturing techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Structural bonding and adhesive joining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience creating clear, step-by-step manufacturing documentation, process specifications, and assembly instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Must be eligible to obtain / maintain US Security Clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$146,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise Test Capabilities (ETC) develops, operates, and scales the shared physical test infrastructure, technical expertise, and execution systems required to validate Anduril&#39;s products across the company. The team provides specialized testing that is capital-intensive, technically complex, safety-critical, or broadly reusable across multiple programs, spanning environmental testing (thermal, vibration, shock, HALT, TVAC), battery testing (cell/module/pack characterization, abuse testing, BMS validation), propulsion testing (engine test cells, thrust/torque measurement, fuel/feed systems), aerodynamic testing (wind tunnel operations, flow visualization, force/moment measurement), and structural testing. We partner with product test teams from early development through qualification and sustainment to identify technical risk, select appropriate test methods, execute testing safely, and generate trusted engineering evidence. The test operations team within ETC owns the lab facilities, equipment fleet, calibration program, and operational support team that keeps this diverse test enterprise running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within ETC is the Internal Capabilities Development (ICD) team, which develops the equipment and test capabilities used by ETC and the broader product teams (Ground Systems, Maritime, Space, Air Dominance &amp;amp; Strike, and Drones). Over the last 3 years, ICD has built large-scale test equipment that has consistently beaten competitive build-vs-buy requests and timelines. We are the &quot;tiger team&quot; that enables Test &amp;amp; Evaluation (T&amp;amp;E) to move at a high pace. Our ground-up builds include Walk-In Thermal Chambers, shipping-container-sized static-fire test stands, Salt Fog chambers, Server Electrical &amp;amp; Heat Load Simulators, Modular Test Chambers, Sand &amp;amp; Dust chambers, and other environmental test equipment built to the MIL-STD-810H standard.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Staff Development Engineer to join the Internal Capabilities Development (ICD) team within ETC in Costa Mesa, CA. This is a hands-on technical leadership role for an engineer who can take a large-scale test capability from concept to commissioned hardware while building the team and processes that let ICD scale. You will design and build equipment to MIL-STD-810H requirements (thermal chambers, static-fire stands, load systems, environmental chambers, and more), owning the mechanical design, fabrication packages, structural and hydraulic considerations, electrical integration, and controls/DAQ that make these systems work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is primarily mechanical, though strong candidates from Electrical or Aerospace backgrounds with solid mechanical design, machining, assembly, and fabrication fundamentals will be considered. You are equally comfortable producing a fabrication drawing package for our machine shop (or external shop) and working hands-on with laser cutting, waterjet, welding, and assembly on the floor. You will lead a small team of engineers, technicians, and interns (2–5 people), take ambiguous capability needs and run with them, and escalate only critical decisions. You will also bring structure to how ICD works by standardizing intake, design reviews, documentation, and build processes as the team grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;938e4d92-92d6-4358-b72e-eb9973ace39d&quot;&gt;Lead development of large-scale test capabilities from requirements and concept through overseeing fabrication, hands-on assembly work, commissioning equipment, and handoff to Development Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;cae88131-48c3-4983-bd9a-781fdcd9bec9&quot;&gt;Own mechanical design and CAD for custom test equipment, including structural, thermal/environmental, and hydraulic/pneumatic subsystems, designed to MIL-STD-810H test methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;2bc1d66e-ad3b-4d31-ab3c-514f4d72128a&quot;&gt;Produce fabrication-ready drawing packages (GD&amp;amp;T, weldments, sheet metal, machined parts) and work directly with our in-house machine/fabrication shop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;40153472-0960-431f-94cb-fed7920dbe49&quot;&gt;Personally perform and oversee fabrication work, including laser cutting, waterjet, welding, machining, and assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;230301c8-5dd9-48a0-8f14-03dbfbdb3106&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and set technical direction for a team of 2–5 engineers, technicians, and interns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;b7c3f411-711c-41f5-b079-8cc3561d7eb5&quot;&gt;Triage incoming capability requests, set priorities, and escalate only critical decisions to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;44dc3e64-8c22-459f-91fe-362b94539099&quot;&gt;Establish and standardize ICD processes, including request intake, design reviews, build procedures, documentation, and handoff criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;46e1d3b7-c3c2-4c7f-ad80-e3d4a2b6d54d&quot;&gt;Oversee integration of PLC controls, LabVIEW/NI DAQ, instrumentation, and electrical enclosures across builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;0880453f-b479-487a-92f6-63e6010334fe&quot;&gt;Lead build-vs-buy assessments and make the case for internal builds where ICD can beat vendor cost and timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;fcd5ba0e-a3dd-4b93-b6cf-33473dcb0ddd&quot;&gt;Partner with ETC and product teams as the capability-development subject matter expert, and support design and test readiness reviews on feasibility, risk, and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;912a586b-4ada-45f6-8e96-d207bd4777a8&quot;&gt;Drive safety culture across lab and build spaces, and ensure proper maintenance of capital equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;dd2050d6-5f81-4b35-8b8f-763b69ec6a72&quot;&gt;Travel to test sites and remote labs as needed to support builds, field testing, or capability standup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;64f0c297-276b-442e-b217-f09d348ae07f&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Mechanical Engineering (Electrical or Aerospace Engineering also considered)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;a2e99b31-bf76-4cec-818b-b575e6c98751&quot;&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience designing and building test equipment or complex electromechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;dbf5b76d-6663-491e-a91e-eed1df025be1&quot;&gt;2+ years leading or mentoring engineers or technicians (formal or informal), ideally teams of 2–5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;8b84c1b1-0f52-421b-8c8e-5bfa681bb532&quot;&gt;Expert mechanical design and CAD proficiency (SolidWorks, NX, or equivalent), including fabrication drawings and GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;8687eb2d-86ba-4b43-ba70-6cdb30939b2a&quot;&gt;Basic hands-on fabrication experience, including any of the following: welding, cnc machining or 3D printing, and assembly
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;0b0a62b7-439a-4695-b824-119bf276afe4&quot;&gt;Ability to delegate to technicians and correct drawing callouts for machine shop to perform: welding, bending, laser cutting, waterjet, machining, and assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;9903bfa6-f812-4ab8-ba54-5d1688830b39&quot;&gt;Experience designing and integrating hydraulic and/or pneumatic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;4c4e00a1-ae43-440e-ab52-92bafd4cb030&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of PLC controls, NI DAQ/LabVIEW, electrical enclosures, and instrumentation, sufficient to design, integrate, and direct others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;93a6252a-830e-40d0-b292-4b8c0c35d345&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to own ambiguous problems end-to-end and deliver working hardware with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;7dec93c9-a8ca-4ee3-b9f1-f68995e7bf94&quot;&gt;Experience establishing or improving engineering processes in a fast-paced, high-mix environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;150aca4f-4632-4a0e-a802-6108167a3234&quot;&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Security Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;7da78923-0366-4456-83db-c59c6d53d0e2&quot;&gt;Experience building large-scale environmental test equipment to MIL-STD-810H (thermal, salt fog, sand &amp;amp; dust, vibration, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;dd66d870-45b6-4f82-8ab4-64c3e73a57a3&quot;&gt;Experience with static-fire stands, dynamometers, or thrust/torque measurement systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;33c89210-4700-4615-84ea-d72987ba1a7f&quot;&gt;Pressure-vessel design or testing experience (ASME BPVC, proof/burst)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;f3543827-2ca6-4d88-b895-71708abf96a1&quot;&gt;Structural analysis/FEA experience for test fixtures and load frames&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;c44d3833-d8f1-46ed-92ab-06fb84bce198&quot;&gt;Closed-loop servo-hydraulic control experience (MTS, Instron, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;d86ba9cf-1d49-4ed6-8190-983b5d80b54a&quot;&gt;HMI or SCADA development for custom equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;ae44c324-5a8a-4563-9c6f-d41775a91819&quot;&gt;Measurement uncertainty analysis and GR&amp;amp;R experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;20206bc6-170c-4740-ba2f-c1b6a805e580&quot;&gt;Experience with defense or aerospace test programs&lt;/li&gt;
