&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Associate degree in Electrical/Electronics, Computer, Mechanical Technologies, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active IPC-610, IPC-620, and J-STD-001 certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
