&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ensure comprehensive documentation is maintained for the project, including technical specifications, user manuals, and project reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuously evaluate and improve project management processes to increase efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
