&lt;li&gt;Experience defining or implementing Mission Autonomy behaviors through UCI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with requirements based testing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mission systems integration, particularly for AI-driven decision-making systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of sensor fusion techniques and their application in autonomous systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automation in Cameo or Python relevant to Systems Engineering use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;INCOSE Systems Engineering Professional (SEP) Certification&lt;/li&gt;
