&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Integrated Product Support Analyst to develop the provisioning and sustainment data that will support our program throughout the entire product lifecycle. This role owns that foundation. Reporting to the Logistics Program Manager, you&#39;ll help build the program’s provisioning dataset, design the operating model that keeps it current as the aircraft matures, and ensure it flows cleanly into the sustainment team&#39;s contract deliverables. It&#39;s a foundational role with real ownership — the decisions you make about how this data is structured and maintained will shape how the program is sustained for years. The Logistics Program Manager retains deliverable accountability and the customer relationship; you own the data domain beneath it and co-author the deliverables that depend on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the provisioning and logistics data baseline&lt;/strong&gt;. Working with cross-functional partners, establish and maintain the authoritative dataset — CAGE codes, part numbers, BOMs, MTBF and failure-rate data, unit prices, provisioning parts lists — as the trusted source the program builds its deliverables against. You bring the different inputs together into one coherent picture the sustainment team can rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run the operating model.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate the process that keeps the dataset current, reconciled, and version-controlled as the design and test results evolve. This is yours to shape from the ground up — a rare chance to define how something works rather than inherit it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across the program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt; Much of this role is bringing people together. Working alongside supply chain, reliability and sustaining engineering, procurement, and design, you’ll gather the data the sustainment mission depends on. You&#39;ll build the relationships and the rhythm that make that collaboration effective and repeatable, earning cooperation through credibility rather than mandate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-author the deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt; Develop the provisioning-based CDRLs and their supporting analysis — sparing recommendations, support equipment data, parts lists — preparing the drafts and the well-reasoned rationale the Logistics Program Manager takes to the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with the whole Integrated Product Support team. &lt;/strong&gt;Your data domain underpins the entire sustainment effort — spares list review, support equipment sourcing, and the clean source data that feeds the logistics engineering and technical writing teams who produce the formal LPD products (LORA, MTA) and Technical Orders. You keep that pipeline healthy and moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the tooling standard.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead with AI-enabled tools to build data solutions quickly, using modern software to work efficiently, all while working fluently through any the government-mandated logistics tools (e.g., Power Log-J) where the contract requires it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in logistics, supply chain, engineering, or a related technical field (equivalent military logistics experience may substitute for education).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of integrated product support, provisioning, or sustainment experience in a defense or military environment — enough to operate independently on provisioning fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of DoD Integrated Product Support, with hands-on depth in provisioning and cataloging: CAGE codes, NSN and part number structures, provisioning parts lists, and how reliability data (MTBF, failure rates) drives sparing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing or directly supporting government logistics deliverables against DIDs and CDRLs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, self-starting approach to cross-functional work — comfortable partnering across engineering, supply chain, and procurement to bring data together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel fluency plus resourcefulness with AI-enabled tools to build solutions independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating with autonomy in a fast-moving program and energized by early-stage, formative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel up to 5–10% domestically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain an active U.S. Secret clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be a U.S. Person due to required access to U.S. export-controlled information or facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Logistics Product Data (GEIA-STD-0007) and government logistics tools (Power Log-J, SlicWave, Tempo, COMPASS, Relyence, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or maintaining a provisioning baseline through a prototype-to-production transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read engineering drawings, parts lists, and BOMs and extract logistics data directly from design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with how LORA, FMECA, and maintenance task analysis outputs drive provisioning and support equipment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with IUID/MIL-STD-130 item identification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$112,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$149,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
