&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong experience with SQL databases, including building custom queries for production and inventory metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proficiency in data analysis and reporting tools such as Tableau, Power BI, or Qlikview.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of supply chain planning systems like Blue Yonder and best practices in demand planning, inventory management, and S&amp;amp;OP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
