&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate, review, and edit documentation, that is user-focused and of the highest quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation covers full development lifecycle – from planning and design to technical configuration, deployment, and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering to ship user-friendly documentation that not only informs and instructs but also contributes to a robust user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Anduril’s technical writing toolkit, working on everything from style guides to the documentation lifecycle and review process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build partnerships across the business to understand our users and our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 4+ years of demonstrated excellence generating technical documentation for various levels of technical audiences for a variety of product types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Aptitude: Reading and interpreting software and hardware user documentation for complex technical products as well as a highly structured certification process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing Ability: A proven clear and persuasive writing and in-person communication skills for a variety of audiences from extremely technical to lay person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission-First Mindset: You put the needs of the customer and the mission first. You are motivated by the opportunity to radically evolve national and allied defense capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: You thrive in unstructured environments. You are a self-starter who can work independently, solve vague technical problems, and drive tasks to completion without constant supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Low-Ego: Collaborate closely with engineering staff, subject matter experts (SMEs) and program management to translate complex technical concepts into clear user-friendly documentation and ensure seamless project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion and Curiosity: A passion for excellent documentation and user experience combined with a curiosity for new technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Skills: Basic development proficiency - we value the ability to apply software development best practices to documentation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Responsibility: The ability to thrive with a high level of autonomy and responsibility, managing competing demands and tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
