&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build end-to-end data integrations that sync customer data to and from Scale&#39;s platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customers&#39; engineering teams to optimize data pipelines, including input on API endpoint design and input/output schemas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain playbooks, internal tools, documentation, and SDKs that set customers up for long-term success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers and Operations to resolve technical blockers, debug delivery issues, and own technical escalations from customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer&#39;s technical experience throughout their time with Scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Account Executives and Product Managers to identify customer-specific feature requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in large language models, 2D image annotation, and API integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Scale and engage with customers at major events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a customer-facing engineer or in a similar hybrid role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on technical experience working with clients in a pre- or post-sales capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development experience with Python, JavaScript, or other modern languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong engineering background, ideally in computer science, mathematics, or another quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to present credibly to both executives and front-line engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort communicating across internal and external teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, empathy, and the ability to move quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
