&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with DeveloperExperience, IT, and product teams to integrate security into all stages of the infrastructure lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and secure infrastructure as code (e.g., Terraform, CloudFormation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and mentor team members on infrastructure security best practices and emerging threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;688&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
