&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, infrastructure, data, and application teams to understand workflow needs and turn them into reusable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, security, and developer experience of services that run critical company workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish technical standards and best practices for distributed workflow development, deployment, testing, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional technical decisions and communicate platform direction clearly to engineers and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
