&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Building on the rapid advancement of the Starship program, we are moving into a new phase of facility and infrastructure growth. As the Starship launch cadence ramps up we are in need of multiple new facilities to support new vehicle builds and reflight refurbishment across various sites. We are currently seeking a construction project engineer to support the rapid development and build of Starship&#39;s next generation vertical integration facilities. It is these facilities that will ultimately enable the path to the Moon, Mars and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
