&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;04825f7f-6fa5-405c-9958-d8a5cd8a38f1&quot;&gt;Experience developing firmware for Xilinx SoC FPGA platforms&amp;nbsp;and designing high-throughput PS/PL interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a860841b-ec2b-41af-865a-af605fe309b9&quot;&gt;Experience with high speed serial links, including GbE, PCI-E or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b1fbf8d4-d683-4e49-a76b-a82ccc0438e5&quot;&gt;Experience with networking protocols and packet processing (Ethernet 802.3, IPV4/IPV4, UDP, TCP)&lt;/li&gt;
