&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0b602d6f-16cf-4119-923f-8e803eef2a14&quot;&gt;Experience developing software for embedded systems in C or C++, or significant experience in another software language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2d8e337b-f519-4576-9e03-faa56e5b8677&quot;&gt;Scripting skills (bash, Perl, Python)&lt;/li&gt;
