&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3dea1901-ad65-43dc-b733-2bca99ccc32d&quot;&gt;Excellent leadership, communication and teamwork skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;da401400-9297-4692-9941-d91cc2a87379&quot;&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain a Top Secret or Top Secret SCI clearance&lt;/li&gt;
