&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to relocate to Starbase, TX (Brownsville, TX area)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand: Up to 3 hours per day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit: Up to 6 hours per day&lt;/li&gt;
