&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Experience with welding, machining, and coating process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Knowledge of principles of chemistry, engineering, fluid dynamics, and mechanics of materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Experience conducting pressure and leak testing using instrumentation such as helium mass spectrometers, flow meters, pressure transducers, and thermocouples&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Experience with capacity modeling, process mapping, and fault analysis&lt;/li&gt;
